WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:03,260
Boss, why do you sell this for fifteen yuan each?

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:12,540
Save clothes. Help me change clothes. I'm carrying a building on the street.

3
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:20,740
Come over quickly and pick me up boldly

4
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,140
Brother Xiao, why did you buy a tricycle?

5
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,110
Yes, aren't I collecting something?

6
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,790
It's more convenient to have this tricycle

7
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:28,830
What house is being demolished?

8
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,430
Aunt Lin, this is me, Brother Xiao

9
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:32,190
You see, I don’t look like someone capable of doing things.

10
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,150
Do you think I, Brother Xiao, look like me?

11
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,910
This guy looks really special

12
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,670
Okay, okay, but how do you charge me?

13
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,350
Auntie, let’s go see your house first

14
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:40,190
Let's see how big it is and how we should deal with it.

15
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,950
Okay, my house is right next to it anyway.

16
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:42,910
Then come with me

17
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:45,310
My house is too old

18
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:46,590
I just want to have some money

19
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:47,710
redecorate it

20
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:48,990
This way I can live more comfortably

21
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:50,270
And my child is also willing to pay

22
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:51,390
But they are too busy working

23
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:52,830
I don’t have time to help me with these things.

24
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:53,950
So I have to do it myself

25
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:55,310
What can I do as an old woman?

26
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:56,830
But ask those people to come over and help smash the wall

27
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,670
What I found is very expensive, so I said

28
00:00:58,670 --> 00:00:59,630
Look there is a labor market nearby

29
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:00,750
Can I ask you to help me with the work?

30
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:01,790
Can you make it a little more convenient?
